\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Life and light and joy are found
\par In the presence of the Lord;
\par Life with richest blessing crowned,
\par Light from many fountains poured;
\par Life and light and holy joy,
\par None can darken or destroy.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Bring to Him life's brightest hours,
\par He will make them still more bright;
\par Give  to Him your noblest powers,
\par He will hallow all your might;
\par Come to Him with eager quest,
\par You shall hear His high behest.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. All your questions large and deep,
\par All the open thoughts of youth,
\par Bring to Him and you shall reap
\par All the harvest of His truth;
\par You shall find in that great store
\par Largest love and wisest lore.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Then when comes life's wider sphere,
\par And its busier enterprise,
\par You shall find Him ever near,
\par Looking with approving eyes,
\par On all honest work and true
\par His dear servants' hands can do.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

